---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="Contact the fixture site" description="A contact form with a Turnstile widget, so the form checks have something to find.">
  <h1>Contact</h1>
  <p>Send a short message and the fixture will not reply, because it is a test site. The form exists so the
    gate has a real form to check: labels, autocomplete, a Turnstile widget and a submit button that works
    without JavaScript.</p>
  <form method="post" action="/contact/">
    <label for="email">Email</label>
    <input id="email" name="email" type="email" autocomplete="email" required />
    <div class="cf-turnstile" data-sitekey="1x00000000000000000000AA"></div>
    <button type="submit">Send</button>
  </form>
</Base>
